451	// width) is a template param so large head dims can use CN=64 (more smem stages fit). The Q (A) tile
452	// always has CTA_M=128 rows while the K/V (B) tiles have CN rows => the per-k-block descriptor stride
453	// differs for A vs B once HD spans >1 col-block (qk_doffR<CTA_M> vs qk_doffR<CN>). ---------------
